              "id": "8afb80b",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>This page explains what JMT Enterprise LLC does with the information you send through this website. If you have a question about your information, or would like it corrected or deleted, email <a href=\"mailto:support@jmtenterprise.net\">support@jmtenterprise.net</a> or call <a href=\"tel:+17209834400\">720-983-4400</a>.</p>",
