              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>We do not sell your information or share it for advertising. It is handled only by the service providers that run this website for us (hosting, the database and photo storage, and email delivery), and only so they can provide that service.</p>",
