              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>If analytics are switched on, they count page visits and form steps only. Your name, contact details, addresses, photos and messages are never sent to analytics, and advertising features are off. Analytics use cookies to tell visits apart. The quote form saves your progress in your own browser so you can pick up where you left off.</p>",
